Note: Tic Tac Toe written entirely in Standard.
Note: The two variables below are captured by the UI event functions.

current_player = "X"
game_over = false

Function Cell1:
    If game_over is false:
        value = text of control cell_1
        If value is "":
            Set text of control cell_1 to current_player
            Disable control cell_1
            CheckGame
        End
    End
End

Function Cell2:
    If game_over is false:
        value = text of control cell_2
        If value is "":
            Set text of control cell_2 to current_player
            Disable control cell_2
            CheckGame
        End
    End
End

